      "statement": "The deterministic media pipeline (transcriber/pipeline.py) is media-only at the orchestrator boundary: it contains ffmpeg audio extract, optional scenedetect slide/scene extraction, and the OpenRouter STT transcribe stage; paid/network post-transcript steps (describe_slides, summarize, Notion, Telegram, S3, cleanup) live in the manifest-gated orchestrator step _process_one.",
