    {
      "id": "claim_d33c2fa6d5ba408fac19ca8d35c898d1",
      "statement": "The Notion publish path is backend-specific: the agy summarize backend publishes via agy's own Notion MCP as part of its run, while the agno summarize backend produces the summary with an OpenRouter model and the engine publishes the Notion subpage directly via the Notion REST API (transcriber.backends.notion_publish.publish_to_notion) with no MCP and no model tool-calling, because the official Notion MCP tool schemas break tool-calling on Gemini/Mistral over OpenRouter.",
