      "id": "claim_341791d82468421aa2e1d87a1cd72210",
      "statement": "Telegram dissemination is implemented by TelegramPublisher in transcriber/publish/telegram.py, which resolves the bot token from the env-var name in config.telegram.bot_token_env, routes by topic with a default-chat fallback, chunks messages to respect Telegram's 4096-character limit, and strips Markdown to clean plain text before sending because messages are sent with no parse_mode.",
